### Create Wrap-up Code
POST http://localhost:8080/api/wrap-up-codes
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "name": "Qayta qo'ng'iroq",
  "outcome": "RETRY",
  "requiresCallbackAt": true
}

### List Enabled Wrap-up Codes (what the operator picks from)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/wrap-up-codes/list
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "page": 0,
  "size": 50,
  "enabled": true
}

### Get Wrap-up Code
GET http://localhost:8080/api/wrap-up-codes/1
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Update Wrap-up Code
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/wrap-up-codes/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "name": "Keyinroq qo'ng'iroq qilish",
  "outcome": "RETRY",
  "requiresCallbackAt": true,
  "enabled": true
}

### Delete Wrap-up Code
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/wrap-up-codes/1
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Wrap Up A Call (as the operator who handled call 42)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/calls/42/wrap-up
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{operator_token}}

{
  "wrapUpCodeId": 1,
  "note": "Ertaga tushdan keyin qulay ekan",
  "callbackAt": "2026-10-07T10:00:00Z"
}
